IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DISTSERVE-SLO.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-WORKERS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PREFILL-WORKERS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 DECODE-WORKERS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SLO-PCT             PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DISTSERVE.
    IF TOTAL-WORKERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF TOTAL-WORKERS >= 4
        MOVE TOTAL-WORKERS TO PREFILL-WORKERS.
        DIVIDE 4 INTO PREFILL-WORKERS.
    ELSE
        MOVE 1 TO PREFILL-WORKERS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE TOTAL-WORKERS TO DECODE-WORKERS.
    SUBTRACT PREFILL-WORKERS FROM DECODE-WORKERS.
    MOVE 99 TO SLO-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 DECODE-WORKERS.
    WEIGHT 30 PREFILL-WORKERS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
